[26;1H[32m+[m[32mfor a replay or test. It sends SMS reminders for booked appointments starting in[m[m
[27;1H[32m+[m[32m`(now, now + 24 hours]` when the patient has SMS consent and a phone number, and[m[m
[28;1H[32m+[m[32monly between 08:00 (inclusive) and 21:00 (exclusive) in each appointment clinic's[m[m
[29;1H[32m+[m[32mtime zone. Quiet-hour reminders wait until an eligible daytime run; appointments[m[m
[30;1H[32m+[m[32mthat have already started are never reminded.[m[m
[31;1H[32m+[m[m
[32;1H[32m+[m[32mRelaywave receives the clinic's `sms_template` with nested `patient`, `appointment`,[m[m
[33;1H[32m+[m[32m`clinician` and `clinic` records in `vars`, plus `appointment.starts_local` (for[m[m
[34;1H[32m+[m[32mexample, `Tue 17 Nov, 09:30`). No local template export is required.[m[m
[35;1H[32m+[m[m
[36;1H[32m+[m[32mSuccessful deliveries are saved in `$CLINIC_DATA/reminders_sent.json`, keyed by[m[m
[37;1H[32m+[m[32mappointment ID and start instant, so moving an appointment to a new start makes it[m[m
[38;1H[32m+[m[32meligible again. Keep this file between runs. Failed sends are not recorded and[m[m
[39;1H[32m+[m[32mwill be retried on the next eligible run. A `reminders_sent.lock` file serializes[m[m
